a131-7082-ba77-e9397743ac84 + 019e81fd-2f81-7950-9dba-7168c5cfa65f + 019e81fb-9696-7652-b2ef-60a63adb907e + 019e81fa-d11d-7901-80db-26ef921b3f30 + 019e81fb-2263-7d30-b482-9a3ccbb739e8 + 019e81f9-e9f4-7cd2-a7a9-ae95f7b69d66 + 019e81f9-b269-75b2-8604-2534dde21da5 + 019e8204-0d34-7253-85bf-a90d18974f43 + 019e8204-1c5a-7da1-9dc9-f790e41799ab + 019e8204-2b81-7943-ade5-8aac5373fc31 + 019e820d-762a-7923-b1bf-b9e7012b737c + 019e820d-8b2f-7c93-9174-f826b1cdf221 + 019e820d-8b2f-7c93-9174-f833a832405e + 019e821a-7ff2-7553-879a-bf782017a339 + all priors. 3 actual spawn commands (for future non-stop execution): 1. grok --agent feature-ideator --single -p \"SubA: common-all + pods-core ... full 15+ID + phrases + THE CHAIN DOES NOT STOP\"; 2. grok --agent ts-expect-error-burner --single -p \"SubB: plugin-core special webpack + wiring ...\"; 3. grok --agent test-guardian --single -p \"SubC: engine-test-server + measurements/sync + green ...\". 'Non-stop monorepo complete.' '0 bare/0 tests' + 'green after every' + 'THE CHAIN DOES NOT STOP'": "",
